  "bio": "Nathalie, affectionately known as Nathy, is a proficient tattoo artist with a keen eye for geometric and dotwork styles. Since 2015, she has been showcasing her talent as a resident artist at Humink in Lucerne, Switzerland. Her dedication to her craft is evident in the precision of her designs, building a reputation for excellence in the intricate realm of tattoos.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Lucerne, Lucerne, Switzerland\n\nresident @dynamite_tattoo_ \n⊹ tattooing since 2015\n⊹\n✺ ʇǝɯlǝɥ ɐ ɹɐǝʍ 'ɥƃnoʇ s,ǝɟᴉl 'ǝɔɐds ǝɟɐs ɐ pǝǝu ʇ,uop noʎ ✺",
